@startuml CL_ActivityDiagrams
' requirement REQ-00025-1

' The entities that take an activity diagram from the source to the SVG:
' the frontend hands an activity tree to the activity module (which owns
' REQ-00024-1 and folds the tree into a flow graph of the IR's activity
' kinds); the engine draws the shapes and lays swimlanes out as columns
' with the shared markup. Module subs are the unit of composition in this
' LLD.

!startsub ActivityDiagrams

!includesub CL_FrontendModule.puml!FrontendModule
!includesub CL_ActivityModule.puml!ActivityModule
!includesub CL_IrModule.puml!IrModule
!includesub CL_SharedModule.puml!SharedModule
!includesub CL_EngineModule.puml!EngineModule

render.frontend.pumlToIr ..> render.activity.isActivity : classify
render.frontend.pumlToIr ..> render.activity.activityToIr : flow graph
render.activity.activityToIr ..> render.ir.validateIr : contract
render.engine.renderSvg ..> render.shared.svgRoot : shapes, columns

!endsub

@enduml
